00:01:25.853 --> 00:01:31.859 size:53% position:73% line:53%
express 439, ici, à Montréal,

00:01:26.887 --> 00:01:35.396 size:53% position:73% line:53%
et on s'attend à

00:01:29.056 --> 00:01:36.430 size:53% position:73% line:53%
